** AUTHORED TEMPLATE — ldo/loop_stability: closed-loop output-impedance peaking (stability proxy).
** Drive an AC current of 1 A into vout; v(vout) = Zout(f). A resonant peak above the DC value =
** ringing / low phase margin. This is the honest stability metric reachable from the
** [vdd,vout,vss] ports — a true loop-gain phase margin needs an internal loop-break node (a future
** ac_loopgain probe), since this LDO's regulation loop is entirely inside the subckt.
